sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as Checkout API
    participant DB as Database
    participant PSP as Payment Provider
    Client->>API: POST /payments + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: reserve key and fingerprint
    API->>PSP: create charge
    PSP-->>API: charge result
    API->>DB: persist result
    API-->>Client: original result
